      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've noticed that the freeze happens:\n\n- On startup\n\n- On video load\n\n- On opening someone's social links\n\nDoes not happen with:\n\n- Image loader\n\n- String loader\n\nSo it's likely not directly related to opening URLs, but it could be related to launching external apps (eac, yt-dlp, url shell exec)\n\nEdit: The startup lag spike happens on the very first loading screen, and seems to actually fix the random EAC false positive popups that VR-mode Linux users have been struggling with.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
